  "body": "Tidy 80sqm 3 Bedroom Home – Ready for Relocation - Priced to sell\r\n\r\nA tidy, practical and affordable relocatable home that’s ready to be moved to your site. At 80sqm, this home offers a great opportunity for anyone looking for a straightforward, easy care home without the cost of building from scratch.\r\n\r\nThe home features three bedrooms, one bathroom and a practical floorplan that makes good use of the space. It’s a great option for a first home, rental, downsizer, bach or additional accommodation.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n• 80sqm relocatable home\r\n• 3 bedrooms\r\n• 1 bathroom\r\n• Durable HardiPlank cladding\r\n• Tile roof\r\n• Aluminium joinery\r\n• Heat pump\r\n• Tidy condition throughout with a great kitchen\r\n• Practical and easy-care layout\r\n• Ready to relocate to your site\r\n• Easy option to downsize to 70sqm with a storage room with external access\r\n\r\nA great little home with plenty of potential. The hard work is already done, giving you the opportunity to get a tidy, comfortable home onto your section without the lengthy process and cost of a new build.\r\n\r\nIf you’re looking for an 80sqm 3 bedroom relocatable at an affordable price, this one is well worth a look. Easy to downsize to 70sqm with a storage room with external access.\r\n\r\nGet in touch to arrange a viewing! Reference: #Oak\r\n\r\nPrice includes GST and relocation within 100kms. Foundations included. Price is for house and relocation only (not the section).\r\n\r\nFor viewing or more information please contact me.\r\nCall/Text or email: Marissa on 0274 999 828 Email: marissa@nzhouseremovals.co.nz\r\n\r\nPrice does not include any Council fees, Architect drawings, Insurance or connections to services.\r\n\r\nWe can help you arrange your building consent and Insurance. Finance, subject to terms and conditions, can be arranged as well.\r\n\r\nUse our inhouse Architect for your house Plans and applications with Council as well as Geotech, engineers and surveyor’s. Call or Text Marissa on 0274999828\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
